>>__ Parse.temp_set_grammars $ valOf $ grammarDB {thyname="hol"};
## `safe_solver_ss`

``` hol4
simpLib.safe_solver_ss : Traverse.ssolver -> ssfrag
```

------------------------------------------------------------------------

Creates a simpset fragment containing one safe solver.

`safe_solver_ss solver` is an anonymous fragment; adding it to a simpset
adds `solver` as `add_safe_solver` does.

### Failure

Never fails.

### Example

``` hol4
>> val c = Context.snapshot();
>> val decide = {name = "decide", solve = K DECIDE} : Traverse.ssolver;
>> simpLib.GEN_SIMP_TAC {safe = true} (bool_ss ++ simpLib.safe_solver_ss decide)
     [] ([], “x < x + 1”) c;
```

### See also

[`simpLib.add_safe_solver`](#simpLib.add_safe_solver),
[`simpLib.solver_ss`](#simpLib.solver_ss).
